OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start for many with
OL,6,Fpatchy fog around for some. Any fog
OL,7,Fshould clear through the morning to
OL,8,Fleave a dry and bright day with
OL,9,Fpleasant autumnal sunshine. Light
OL,10,Feasterly winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry overnight with plenty of
OL,13,Fclear spells across the region. Fog
OL,14,Fmay once again redevelop in prone
OL,15,Fspots. Chilly, with frost possible in
OL,16,Frural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
