OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry but somewhat cloudier for
OL,6,Fmany, although some bright or hazy
OL,7,Fsunshine possible. Rain arriving into
OL,8,Fthe south later and winds increasing
OL,9,Fthrough the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloud
OL,12,Fand patchy rain to the south initially
OL,13,Fon Wednesday but turning brighter for
OL,14,Fall through the afternoon. Dry and
OL,15,Fbright conditions continue beyond
OL,16,Fthis, turning chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
